Package: enigma2-skin-mohammedskin
Version: 2.1.135
Description: MohammedSkin - cinematic FHD skin for OpenViX, OpenBlackHole, OpenATV, PurE2 and EGAMI
 Adapts itself to the installed image. Infobar, second infobar (classic, four scenes or two scenes)
 and channel list with posters, backdrops, scenes and rating stars fetched online (cached in /tmp only),
 colour themes, menu and channel list styles, classic clocks, Arabic event translation,
 signal meters in dB, pulsing transponder readout, softcam server info, channel and plugin list sizes,
 infobar transparency, a filter that hides adult posters, weather, Arabic fonts,
 Arabic posters for Arabic channels, a 3D channel logo when there is no poster,
 ten colour themes, glass channel list styles with tabs and sidebars, and a plugin grid.
Section: skin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Mohammed
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: 124152
Depends: enigma2
Recommends: python3-pillow
